id: SAVE16-3
package: fandhe-workshop-web
test: history_import
target: crates/web/src/host.rs
find:         self.dirty = self.registry.fields().map(|f| f.name).collect();
replace:         self.dirty = Vec::new();
expect-fail: open_marks_every_field_dirty_and_notifies_the_next_tick
note: 読み込みの後に field を dirty に積まない（画面が再描画されない）
